Task Plaza package

Activity projection and status copy derive from the reviewed Progress package
at cd6dda4 and Sailry ef5e82ea desktop/activity source, under Apache-2.0.
The independent package owns the line scene, stable seating and detail selection;
authoritative session activity, approvals and navigation remain shared services.

The transparent worker atlas was generated with the built-in
OpenAI ImageGen tool, using the user-approved Task Plaza design as the reference.
The art direction follows the committed City Trader package at 6b09490695ae4d592ba3e4b8ee1b1eef73fd33f0;
no City Trader artwork is copied. Prompts accompany the final assets.

GPUI Kit has no miniature workspace scene component. Furniture and people use
transparent image layers; ground, room outlines and whiteboards use native Kit
geometry and theme tokens. Toolbar, buttons, focus, tooltips and resizing use Kit.
Details embed the shared native conversation sidebar through the public SDK.
